# Add only narrow, source-specific Doxygen warning exceptions here. Each
# exception requires a reason and remains visible with rebuild_doc --show-suppressed.
#
# Doxygen's general "is not documented" diagnostics are disabled in doc/conf.py:
# reference pages explicitly select their documented API, so absence of a comment on
# an arbitrary parsed declaration is not actionable. All diagnostics Doxygen emits
# continue to be shown unless an exception is configured below.

